  "details": "Open beta adds the ability to hide the mic icon completely, but what I'm hoping for is the ability to hide the white states but still have the visible \"muted\" warning, so I can still be sure whether I'm muted or not.\nAnother way of saying this is: I'd like to be able to adjust the opacity for the mic's \"unmuted\" icon independently of the opacity for the \"muted\" icon, so I can turn the \"unmuted\" opacity to zero, but still have the \"muted\" opacity at 100%, since that's the information that I actually want to see.",
